{"id":553,"name":"krookodile","speciesId":553,"dex":553,"form":"normal","generation":5,"types":["ground","dark"],"stats":{"hp":95,"attack":117,"defense":80,"special-attack":65,"special-defense":70,"speed":92},"abilities":[{"name":"intimidate","hidden":false},{"name":"moxie","hidden":false},{"name":"anger-point","hidden":true}],"height":15,"weight":963,"baseExp":234,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/553.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/553.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/553.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/553.ogg","genus":"Intimidation Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"black","text":"They never allow prey to escape. Their jaws are so powerful, they can crush the body of an automobile."},{"version":"white","text":"It can expand the focus of its eyes, enabling it to see objects in the far distance as if it were using binoculars."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Very violent Pokémon, they try to clamp down on anything that moves in front of their eyes."},{"version":"sun","text":"Its unique faculty of sight can detect small prey more than 30 miles away, even in the midst of a sandstorm."},{"version":"moon","text":"After clamping down with its powerful jaws, it twists its body around to rip its prey in half."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"When it spots prey, even at a distance of over 30 miles, it swims through the desert as if it were water, then jumps out and chomps them."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It conceals itself in sandstorms that Flygon whip up and waits patiently for prey to appear."},{"version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon is known as the Bully of the Sands. Krookodile’s mighty jaws can bite through heavy plates of iron with almost no effort at all."},{"version":"shield","text":"While te